        "original_id": "28683f52-3724-589f-9504-08c0e85adca6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gabe Turner, Kevin Spacey, Meryl Streep, Arnold Schwarzenegger, David Beckham, James Corden, Billy Crystal\n- Roles: Producer, Director, Writer, Actor\n- Films: The Usual Suspects, American Beauty, The Guvnors\n- Topics: TV and film collaborations, Academy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- In the early 1990s, Kevin Spacey gained critical acclaim as an actor.\n- In 1995, Kevin Spacey won the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for The Usual Suspects.\n- In 1999, Kevin Spacey won the Academy Award for Best Actor for American Beauty.\n- In 2014, The Guvnors was released as a film directed by Gabe Turner.\n- Gabe Turner has worked as a producer, director, and writer on TV and film projects.\n- Gabe Turner has regularly collaborated on TV and film projects featuring Meryl Streep, Arnold Schwarzenegger, David Beckham, James Corden, Billy Crystal, and Kevin Spacey.",
